# The front-end controller-configuration editor (pak flow; w28r, written with script_probe --text).
# 4 START; 7 A -> PLAYER 1 (JUST PLAY, CONTROLLER PAK, CREATE PLAYER, CONTROLS); DOWN x3 = CONTROLS, which is a
# LEFT/RIGHT selector: RIGHT, then A opens the editor (frame 510: GAS, BRAKE, STEERING, SHIFT UP/DOWN, REVERSE, ABORT, VIEW,
# WINGS/SHOOT, RUMBLE, RESET CONTROLS); LEFT/RIGHT/RIGHT on every row, A on RESET CONTROLS, B back.
# (A on CONTROLS without the RIGHT starts JUST PLAY; the pause-menu CONTROLS screen is pause_menus.press.)
# Reaches drone_throttle_calc and game_results_exit (the editor's per-player state, historical labels: reached by no
# other script), func_80100564, game_results_input, func_800D816C (Astra's), func_800D9058, func_800D8078.
